{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41603","headline":"寄落星史虚白处士 · 伍乔","name":"寄落星史虚白处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云峰下古溪头，曾与提壶烂熳游。\n登阁共看彭蠡水，围炉相忆杜陵秋。\n棊玄不厌通高品，句妙多容隔岁酬。\n别後相思时一望，暮山空碧水空流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}